WEBVTT

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:03.390
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:06.360
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.860
Thus far on Aikatsu!

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.490
The Starlight Queen Cup is upon us.

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:18.120
After Masquerade performed the opening act, Miya-chan's identity was finally revealed to be...

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.540
Ichigo's mom!

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.870
We talked to Angely Sugar's 
Asuka-san about a lot of things.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:29.250
The only person who can understand what makes you happy is yourself.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:39.310
<i>What is it that really makes me happy? {if you're going to use a question mark, make it a question}</i>

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:22.580
The concert that will decide the idol who stands above the rest, the Starlight Queen Cup,

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:24.580
is only two short days away!

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:28.960
Only a single idol will be able to challenge the current Queen, Kanzaki Mizuki.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.960
The first concert will decide who that idol will be.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:36.000
The whole country is waiting with bated breath for the result.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.330
Everyone's really fired up.

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:40.030
Yeah, especially this year.

00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:41.090
Are they?

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.040
It has to be, if you say so...

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:45.820
There's no mistaking it!

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.630
I wonder what's going on with Aoi. {question marks go with questions}

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:56.630
Headmistress Orihime called her in first thing in the morning.

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:57.780
Hope it's not bad.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.460
Please excuse me.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:05.280
Aoi?

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.140
What happened?

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.070
Your face is saying it's important.

00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:11.040
Yeah...

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.040
I got the part...

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:15.920
The leading role in a movie!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.660
Congratulations, Aoi!

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:21.930
That's amazing. Good job!

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:23.460
Thanks!

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.140
Speaking of amazing...

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.490
Just a bit of celebration.

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:31.390
Ran and I infiltrated the kitchen.

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.620
We made it for you ourselves.

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:37.020
The cafeteria lady was shocked silent.

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.890
I think I can imagine that perfectly.

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:42.030
Hurry up and dig in.

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.840
Just don't forget to leave some for me.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.070
Okay, okay.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.530
Then let's get started!

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:52.540
It's great! The cream is melting in my mouth.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:53.670
Have some, Ichigo.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:56.470
That's what I wanted to hear! Without further ado...

00:03:56.470 --> 00:03:59.710
So what kind of movie are you going to be starring in?

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:00.890
Delicious!

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:01.800
The movie's name is...

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.260
"Naughty Inspector".

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:05.050
"Inspector"?

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:07.340
It's not "Naughty Detective"?

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:13.120
I got promoted to inspector!

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:19.310
It's hitting the theaters this winter break,

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:23.320
and they think it'll be even more popular than "Dancing Criminal Investigation".

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:24.820
Wow!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.070
Seems like all your hard work has finally paid off.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.680
Ran, you should eat too.

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:29.680
Sure.

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:34.480
The producer and director said they wanted to make a movie just for me.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:37.700
I really think we put too many sweet things in.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:39.340
It's fine! We're celebrating!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.090
I guess I can't argue with that.

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.580
Yeah, it's great!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.970
So Ran's in a private lesson?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:47.430
Yep.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:50.680
She said she might have an important audition coming up.

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:53.180
Come on, let's go over the song we're doing.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:59.480
It was a good idea to come out under the moonlit sky to listen to "Moonlight Destiny".

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:04.040
I could listen to this song forever.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.820
Me too, I just love the lyrics.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:12.020
<i>We are surely living the dream</i> {italics'd, though we might want even more distinguishment}

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:17.790
<i>we promised each other before we were born.</i>

00:05:15.010 --> 00:05:17.790
We are surely living the dream we promised each other before we were born.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:27.280
<i>The two of us share this precious moment.</i>

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:28.860
"The two of us share this precious moment." That's so wonderful!

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:29.850
Don't you think?

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:32.380
A promise from before we were born...

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:34.500
I wonder if you and I have something like that.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:34.930
Huh?

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:37.300
I can't help but believe in it.

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:41.940
Something tells me that we made a promise to become idols together.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:47.600
If you think about it, even though we've only been at Starlight Academy for a year,

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:50.740
we're both competing in the Queen Cup. {just "Queen Cup"?}

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:52.930
Yeah, that's right!

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:55.370
We really might have made a promise like that.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:59.460
After all, if you hadn't been there for me, I wouldn't even be an idol.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.550
Same here. I wouldn't be as sure of myself if you weren't with me. {I can't tell if this is off} {it is}

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.200
I also wouldn't be here if we weren't friends with Ran.

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:05.880
Me too.

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:10.570
I'm sure I wouldn't have gotten that movie part if it weren't for you.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.700
Ichigo, thank y— {I'm not sure you're allowed to cut a word off like this but whatever}

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.880
Stop right there, this isn't the end of anything yet.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:17.910
Very true.

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:22.470
Oh, Ran! Welcome back.

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:24.010
How was your lesson?

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:25.310
Excellent.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:28.110
Anyway, check out what I just got.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:29.570
Isn't that...

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:34.080
So Spicy Ageha's having another audition for their representative model. {model rep? what I've got is what we used last time} {whatever}

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.450
They are.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:42.420
I may have failed last time, but I really want to make it now!

00:06:43.810 --> 00:06:45.800
You'll become a muse if you pass.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:51.260
Yeah. I want to become a muse who can make fans and designers alike shine even more brilliantly!

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:52.380
You <i>will </i>become one.

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:53.930
Yeah, I know you can do it!

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:57.380
Hearing that from you two really gives me confidence.

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:58.140
Thank you!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.230
Sure!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:05.900
<i>After the Starlight Queen Cup ends,</i>

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:09.310
<i>Aoi'll be in a movie, and Ran has her muse audition.</i>

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:11.450
<i>I have to work just as hard as them. {technically "they"}</i>

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.750
There's only one day left until the Cup.

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:19.710
Let's put everything we've got into one last training session.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:24.160
<i>Gaze into the mirror</i>

00:07:24.160 --> 00:07:30.360
<i>and tell me who you see on the other side</i>

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.220
Yurika-chan is so cool!

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:29.090
Yeah!

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:31.550
But do you think she'd let us join her? {come on}

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:37.290
Guess you saw us.

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:42.850
You're all a thousand years too early to attempt to spy on such a sacred ritual as my private lesson.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.150
Do you want me to gulp down all your blood?!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:49.150
Yurika-chan, is it just me, or are you even more vampiric than usual?

00:07:50.090 --> 00:07:54.780
I-I suppose that's not necessarily incorrect.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:58.220
It's to be expected, considering the 
Starlight Queen Cup is a just a day away. {24 hours is too precise!}

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:02.250
That's one reason, but I've also been invited to be in the S.P.Q.Rock Fest. {also, is this what she means?}{yeah, I'm open to better ideas}

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.480
You mean <i>that</i> S.P.Q.Rockfest?!

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:05.410
Congrats!

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:06.540
Good job!

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:10.920
Either way, I'd like to be left to my own devices so I can focus on my ritual.

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:15.050
If you three don't hurry up back to your own lessons,

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.810
I'll suck your blood!

00:08:16.810 --> 00:08:17.930
Delivery!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.680
Here's your garlic ramen, with plenty of extra garlic.

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:23.020
Thank you!

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:26.420
We won't lose to her in effort! {argh}

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:26.900
Oh?

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:31.030
Good morning.

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:34.180
Morning, Sakura-chan. 
Is it just you today?

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.170
The others all have work today.

00:08:36.170 --> 00:08:37.030
Like what?

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:39.710
Otome-sama is recording for a TV show,

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:42.110
and Kaede-sama is busy with a magazine shoot.

00:08:42.110 --> 00:08:45.590
I myself will be occupied with a talk show after practice.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.980
Here it comes, the big job rush!

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:49.500
That's a good thing for idols.

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:52.260
I cannot even begin to express my gratitude to you all.{I feel like Sakura calmed down back to her original self} {thank fucking god}

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:57.330
<i>It's not just Aoi and Ran.</i>

00:08:57.330 --> 00:09:00.560
<i>Everyone is thinking about what's beyond the Starlight Queen Cup.</i>

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:06.900
<i>They've all decided on their own goals, and are working their hardest to achieve them.</i>

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:13.110
<i>I have to find my own goal soon...</i>

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.950
It's just about time for the final selection, yeah!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.240
Yes, the anticipation is building up to a record-breaking climax.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.560
The honeys have put everything they've got into their final lessons.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:28.580
I'm sure this'll turn out to be an extraordinary concert, yeah!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:33.320
I agree. But this is simply a 
jumping-off point for the girls.

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:38.850
There's no doubt that the Starlight Queen Cup
 is a once-in-a-lifetime event for them.

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:41.860
But at the same time, it is but a single milestone.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:47.270
I'm certain that after coming this far in their activities, they realize that as well.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.770
Good evening.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:52.600
Oh, where's Aoi?

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.410
She's at a meet-and-greet for the movie.

00:09:54.410 --> 00:09:55.420
I see.

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:58.440
Sorry, but this is all I can offer you.

00:09:58.440 --> 00:09:59.530
Thanks.

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:01.800
Make yourself at home.

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.870
I've just got to finish this up.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:05.520
What're you writing?

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:07.350
My entry to the audition.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:09.660
I need to put all of my feelings on paper.

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:11.290
I see.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:18.860
I've been thinking too.

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:22.760
About what I should do from now on...

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:27.000
Something like Aoi's acting, or your modeling.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:30.660
I want to figure out what I should focus on in order to shine even more.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.370
I understand.

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:36.400
The path to becoming a star isn't something other people can show you.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:39.960
Finding your own road to brilliance is your job as an idol.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:42.580
I wonder if I'll be able to find something... {!!!}

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:44.660
Haven't you been doing Aikatsu this whole time?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:48.880
Don't overlook everything you've done to get here.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:53.380
Don't you think there are plenty of hints among what you've experienced so far?

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.220
Start by eating that seaweed you've got. {I can't help but feel it's wrong to use seaweed} {me too, but it can't really be helped}

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:09.020
The only person who can understand what makes you happy is yourself.

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:12.730
<i>What should I do to be happy?</i>

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:14.470
<i>I don't know...</i>

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:22.030
Sleep tight, Ichigo.

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:22.030
<i>If there's ever anything you want to talk about, don't hesitate to ask me.</i>

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.970
<i>I have to do this on my own.</i>

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:37.050
<i>Becoming an idol, and everything I did with my friends after that</i>

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.070
<i>are all happy memories.</i>

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:42.550
<i>My idol activities were always passionate and exciting. {empassioned? not sure I'm using the word right}</i>

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:47.510
<i>If only I could find some way to be more passionate and excited about my idol activities...</i>

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.230
I know!

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:55.690
Kaede-chan!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.320
Strawberry?

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.230
What's up?

00:11:58.230 --> 00:11:59.090
Kaede-chan!

00:11:59.090 --> 00:11:59.820
What?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.820
There's something I'd like you to tell me!

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:18.330
Oh, welcome back.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:19.340
Hey there.

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:21.140
How was the meet-and-greet?

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:22.740
It was incredible!

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:26.680
The director was telling me about all his interesting ideas, one after the other.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.540
Wow.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.870
I've got so much to tell you!

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.060
I'm all ears!

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:31.980
I wanted to talk to you too.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:35.290
Cool, but let's put this off until tomorrow.

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:38.440
We should get our beauty sleep for the concert tomorrow.

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.190
Sounds good to me.

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:52.960
The selection round of the 
Starlight Queen Cup is finally here!

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:57.460
Everyone in the audience is excited to the max! {I don't know how to feel about this one} {"to the max" is always okay}

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:02.210
We're here, live at the Starlight Academy stage, broadcasting nationwide!

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:04.920
Mom! Mom! It's about to start!

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.340
Don't worry, I'm watching.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:08.960
Wow, KiraKiratter is exploding!

00:13:08.960 --> 00:13:13.100
Moreover, this concert will be 
livestreamed over the Internet as well,

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:16.850
allowing viewers to watch the Cup no matter where they are.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:19.420
It's time.

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:20.650
Yeah!

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:25.550
Among the live audience is of course none other than the one and only Kanzaki Mizuki-san!

00:13:25.550 --> 00:13:30.120
Whichever idol comes out on top today will directly face Kanzaki-san in one final concert for the title!

00:13:30.540 --> 00:13:32.880
Just who will surpass the rest?!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:47.320
And there goes the message to Dad.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:48.990
It's almost time to go on.

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:52.430
We're finally all here!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.700
The Starlight Queen Cap! {or whatever} {eh}

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:01.820
Is it Cap now?

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.820
Be careful not to bite your tongue.

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:05.940
Right at the last minute, too.

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:08.950
She couldn't let a perfect opportunity like this pass.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:11.660
Pwah!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:12.860
Pwah?

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:16.660
I was so nervous I had forgotten to breathe.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.080
You really intend to die?

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:22.670
I didn't realize I was holding my breath until Ichigo-tan bit her tongue like that.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:25.390
I didn't know you could even get nervous, Otome.

00:14:25.390 --> 00:14:29.300
How could I not?! It's the Starlight Queen Cup!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.680
We're about to decide who the top idol is!

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:34.240
When you say it so bluntly...

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:38.050
But doesn't it make you laugh?

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:43.660
I bet nobody in the audience would ever expect us to be messing around like this.

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:44.610
That's true.

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:48.930
You're all such good friends that you can relax like this right before a competition.

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:51.860
That might be the biggest culture shock I've had yet.

00:14:51.860 --> 00:14:54.820
It's all Ichigo's fault that the atmosphere is so loose now.

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:56.200
Loosey-goosey, you know?

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:01.210
Let's give our fans the time of their lives today.

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:04.150
Yeah, I love being on stage with you all.

00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:04.910
Same here.

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:06.840
I think I'll be happy no matter who wins.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.340
Me too!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:12.850
Then let's get this started.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.530
Who's going to lead?

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:18.830
Ichigo, of course.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.060
It's your punishment for misspeaking.

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:23.730
Leave it to me.

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:29.260
Always passionate,

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:31.740
Ai-katsu!

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.500
That was an unforgettable concert!

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.130
The approval rating is currently being calculated. {...they used the excitement meters?} {why not?}

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.130
Raichi, you're too close.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:20:01.630
Approval ratings from all of the Starlight Queen Cup viewers have finally been totaled.

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:08.070
Who will be the idol to square off in the final round with the current Queen, Kanzaki Mizuki?

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:13.150
Kanzaki Mizuki-san herself will be announcing the winner.

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:21.530
The name of the one lucky idol is written on a card inside the sealed envelope Mizuki-san is holding.

00:20:23.810 --> 00:20:27.000
Well then, Mizuki-san, we leave the rest to you.

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:30.290
Hello everyone, Kanzaki Mizuki here.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.230
That was a truly wonderful concert.

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:36.290
Each and every one of you was burning brightly.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:41.420
But among you all was a single idol who shined like the sun and stole the hearts of millions.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:45.310
I could tell exactly whose name would be on this card without even looking.

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:47.950
Hoshimiya Ichigo!

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.440
So you made it this far.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:03.680
The next concert here will be a showdown between Hoshimiya Ichigo and myself.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:06.920
I'm very much looking forward to seeing how things will go.

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:09.560
Ichigo, let's Aikatsu to the full extent of our abilities.

00:21:09.560 --> 00:21:10.950
R-Right!

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:12.950
Good luck!

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:13.830
Ichigo-chan, congratuations!

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:15.960
You're amazing!

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:20.000
Wow... everyone, thank you so much!

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:28.850
Man, even though I lost, I'm looking forward to the finals way too much!

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:31.110
I'm Ichigo's number one fan, after all.

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:32.930
Yeah, I won't let you down.

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:34.490
We'll all be cheering for you.

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:35.600
Thanks!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:36.820
By the way...

00:21:36.820 --> 00:21:38.030
What is it?

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:40.650
Well actually, I have something to tell you both.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.530
Come to the cafeteria in ten minutes.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.240
Aoi!

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:47.070
Just wait there a bit!

00:21:47.890 --> 00:21:51.100
Excuse me, one extra-large celebratory parfait please.

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:53.770
Please write out "Congratulations, Ichigo" with the chocolate.

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:54.700
Okay!

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:57.510
Aoi-chan, you're such a good friend.

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.130
Did you order Ichigo's parfait? {uh, Strawberry parfait?}

00:22:00.130 --> 00:22:01.030
Yep.

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:02.810
I'll have a cola.

00:22:02.810 --> 00:22:03.710
Coming up!

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:06.470
I never expected that of Ichigo, though.

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:10.100
Her saying that she's going to leave Starlight Academy.

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:15.900
On the other hand, doing something like this is pretty much par for the course for Ichigo.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:19.730
Wait, Aoi...

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:21.440
Did she not tell you?

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:57.660
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.550 --> 00:24:00.950
Today was really nerve-wracking.

00:24:00.950 --> 00:24:03.400
It's a good thing Ichigo bit her tongue and calmed us down.

00:24:03.400 --> 00:24:06.190
Our frozen nerves turned into jello thanks to her.

00:24:06.190 --> 00:24:07.380
That's true.

00:24:08.020 --> 00:24:09.860
Laugh when you're nervous.

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:13.790
Why are you quitting Starlight Academy, Ichigo?

00:24:13.790 --> 00:24:17.600
I'm sure that even more passionate Aikatsu are waiting for me out there.

00:24:17.600 --> 00:24:18.380
Ichigo...

00:24:18.380 --> 00:24:20.020
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:21.850
Memories lie in the future.

00:24:21.850 --> 00:24:25.870
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
